[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5041.11, "timestamp": "01:24:01", "text": "那真的很好，因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5043.75, "timestamp": "01:24:03", "text": "那里的交通状况确实像他们说的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5045.669, "timestamp": "01:24:05", "text": "真是听话。好的？即使有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5048.07, "timestamp": "01:24:08", "text": "没有人，人们仍然像什么都没发生过一样服从。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5048.121, "timestamp": "01:24:08", "author": "@saikatdey0909", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mT2Up10wsYYwilcayEwYxOCwTgzDSnNztFejTB-x02nR8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "HelloUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ-r4KpS3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5049.59, "timestamp": "01:24:09", "text": "如果没有人，就像没有车一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5053.629, "timestamp": "01:24:13", "text": "来了，但他们仍然服从服从"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5055.91, "timestamp": "01:24:15", "text": "交通规则。所以你不必"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5057.27, "timestamp": "01:24:17", "text": "别担心任何事。你只需要"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5058.876, "timestamp": "01:24:18", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "the thing is, walking is okay when there's an actual sidewalk like in Japan 😆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5059.189, "timestamp": "01:24:19", "text": "自己学习交通规则并获取"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5061.11, "timestamp": "01:24:21", "text": "如果你想四处逛逛，可以骑自行车。只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5063.27, "timestamp": "01:24:23", "text": "停车时要小心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5064.95, "timestamp": "01:24:24", "text": "循环。注意停车地点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5066.79, "timestamp": "01:24:26", "text": "比如知道在哪里停车，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5069.669, "timestamp": "01:24:29", "text": "有时他们会像指着什么东西一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5072.55, "timestamp": "01:24:32", "text": "现在是雨季，所以八月份会有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5074.99, "timestamp": "01:24:34", "text": "雨季。获得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5077.35, "timestamp": "01:24:37", "text": "伞。但如果你坚持下去，如果你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5078.629, "timestamp": "01:24:38", "text": "如果你不小心使用雨伞，它就会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5082.229, "timestamp": "01:24:42", "text": "被盗。我的天啊。等等，这居然是真的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5085.35, "timestamp": "01:24:45", "text": "它被偷了。它被偷了。呃，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5087.03, "timestamp": "01:24:47", "text": "你的钱不会被偷。好的。你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5088.95, "timestamp": "01:24:48", "text": "手机不会被偷。如果你把你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5090.87, "timestamp": "01:24:50", "text": "把钱包放在某个地方，就不会被偷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5092.95, "timestamp": "01:24:52", "text": "唯一会被偷走的东西是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5096.629, "timestamp": "01:24:56", "text": "你的雨伞和你的内衣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5099.43, "timestamp": "01:24:59", "text": "什么？就是这样。什么？我是"}]